"developer commands, listed here for reference, do not show them in bot's menu"

## Developer commands

- `/devstats`: Show deployment metrics.
- `/stats`: Show user and group totals.
- `/clonestatus`: List hosted clone states.
- `/clonepayments`: List recent clone payments on the main bot.
- `/refundstar <payment_id>`: Refund a recorded clone payment and remove its slot grant on the main bot.
- `/anistats`: Show anime module statistics.
- `/plreports`: List open playlist reports.
- `/plban <playlist_id>`: Ban a playlist and resolve its reports.
- `/plunban <playlist_id>`: Remove a playlist ban.

## Owner commands

- `/exec <shell command>`: Execute a shell command.
- `/eval <Python code>`: Evaluate Python with message snapshots.
- `/prun <Python code>`: Evaluate Python with message snapshots. Alias: `/peval`.
- `/restart`: Restart the deployment process.
- `/logs`: Read the recent deployment log.
- `/anidbcleanup`: Run anime database cleanup.
- `/anieval <Python code>`: Evaluate Python with message snapshots.
- `/term <shell command>`: Execute a shell command.